{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":50,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的罪恶"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华说：",{"text":"“我休你们母亲的休书在哪里呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我把你们卖给了我哪一个债主呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们被卖是因为你们的罪恶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们的母亲被休是因为你们的过犯。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么我来的时候一个人也不在？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为什么我呼唤的时候没有人回答？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我的臂膀太短不能救赎你们吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是我没有能力拯救你们吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我斥责一声，海就干了；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使江河变为旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"鱼类因无水而干死，发出腥臭。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我使黑暗遮蔽诸天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用麻布掩盖天空。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["主仆的顺服"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"主耶和华赐我受教者的舌头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使我知道用什么话帮助疲乏的人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"每天早晨，主唤醒我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫我像受教者那样侧耳聆听。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主耶和华开了我的耳朵，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我没有悖逆，也没有退缩。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人打我的背，我任他打；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人拔我的胡子，我任他拔；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人侮辱我，朝我吐唾沫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不掩面。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我并不羞愧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为主耶和华帮助我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我面如坚石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"知道自己必不会蒙羞。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为我伸张正义的来了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁要控告我呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让我们来理论吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁是我的控告者呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让他到我这里来吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，有主耶和华帮助我，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"谁能定我有罪呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，他们都要像衣服一样渐渐破旧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被蛀虫吃掉。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["信靠上帝"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"你们中间谁敬畏耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听从祂仆人的话？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行在黑暗中、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有光的人要信靠耶和华的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"仰赖自己的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然而，你们自己点火、自备火把的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"靠自己点亮火光和燃起火把行走吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们必落入悲惨的境地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华亲手所定的。","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/50.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/51.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/49.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}